---
title: Blog
layout: layout.njk
description: Notes, projects, and photo-heavy writeups from Dom.
url: /blog/
---

<div class="row">
    <div class="two-thirds column">
        <h1>Blog</h1>
        <p>Posts live here. Each post gets its own page under <strong>/blog/</strong>, so adding new entries stays straightforward.</p>

        {% set posts = search.pages("type=blog-post", "date=desc") %}
        {% if posts.length %}
            {% for post in posts %}
                <article>
                    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a></h2>
                    {% if post.date %}
                        <p><small>{{ post.date | formatDate }}</small></p>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if post.description %}
                        <p>{{ post.description }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                </article>
                {% if not loop.last %}
                    <hr/>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
            <p>No posts published yet.</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>